{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いていただき、\nありがとうございます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "埼玉県出身のえんどうりこです。☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobuL0Unu.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobBmlmEQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob7w9wXa.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15枚目シングルミート&グリート始まったね〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "3日後にまた会える！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "毎週会える日が続きそうで嬉しい☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日は黒い洋服です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "黒珍しいね。\nって言ってもらえたり、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "黒い服よく見かける気がする。\nって言ってもらえる日だった！笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "個人的にはグレーの洋服をつい手に取っている気がします。。。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "実際どうかはわかりません、🤔\n観察してみて〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リアルミート&グリートで着る服も、\nもう決めてる！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しみにしててね！ﾜｸﾜｸ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobXatwlj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "NHK-FM「ミュージックライン」に綺良さんと2人で出演させていただきました〜！！🐱"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "話すスピード感についていけるように頑張ったのですが、難しかったです🤔"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "綺良さんならではの言葉選びも大好きなので、\n一緒にお話しできて嬉しかったです☺︎\n沢山笑わせていただきました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/moblTpEaU.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobTfI9p9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ジャケ写の日はゆづを褒めすぎて驚かれました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だって綺麗すぎたんだもーん。🙂‍↕️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobJ6L9io.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほら！！\nかわいいー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobbwjCB4.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "絶対伸ばしすぎだよね。？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "れいなちゃんのイタズラ笑顔だー。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "意外とお気に入りの一枚です。☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日19時から「STAR」に出演させていただきます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『What's \"KAZOKU\"？』"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひみてください☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは、今日のブログはここまで！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただき、\nありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね！"}], "source": "official"}